{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":17.6},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.799,"end":29.76},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":31.28,"end":41.44}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.8,"text":"微積分提供描述運動變化的工具。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.6,"end":8.08,"text":"軌道不能只有一張圖：我們需要每個水平位置的高度，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.32,"end":10.4,"text":"也需要描述方向的方法。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.28,"end":13.04,"text":"這個模型研究曲線，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.12,"end":15.36,"text":"不是經過認證的遊樂設施，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.6,"end":17.6,"text":"也沒有完整計算作用力。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.799,"end":19.76,"text":"固定彎曲參數，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.92,"end":22.24,"text":"把 x 從 −2 移到 2。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.88,"end":23.92,"text":"追蹤點的位置，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.16,"end":26.32,"text":"比較高度與切線方向。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.6,"end":29.76,"text":"函數 y = f(x) 指定什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":31.28,"end":33.44,"text":"函數 y = f(x) 指定什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.64,"end":38.24,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.88,"end":41.44,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}